    - target: {fileID: 7914859355852311124, guid: 5aabb13ac990d4e79bb8cfa02ca1092b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Bir zamanlar Hollowvale, bilgeli\u011Fiyle tan\u0131nan bir b\xFCy\xFCc\xFC
        kasabas\u0131yd\u0131.\r\nAncak yasak b\xFCy\xFClerin pe\u015Fine d\xFC\u015Fen
        bir \xF6\u011Frenci, dengeleri geri d\xF6n\xFClmez \u015Fekilde bozdu.\r\n\r\nKontrolden
        \xE7\u0131kan bir rit\xFCelin ard\u0131ndan kasaba sessizli\u011Fe g\xF6m\xFCld\xFC.\r\nB\xFCy\xFCc\xFCler
        ruhlar\u0131ndan ayr\u0131ld\u0131, zaman\u0131n i\xE7inde kayboldu\r\nve
        Hollowvale sisin ard\u0131nda unutuldu.\r\n\r\nBu felaketten sa\u011F kurtulan
        tek ki\u015Fi ise gen\xE7 bir cad\u0131 \xE7\u0131ra\u011F\u0131yd\u0131:
        Luna.\r\n\r\nArt\u0131k Luna, kay\u0131p ruhlar\u0131n yank\u0131lar\u0131
        aras\u0131nda ilerleyerek\r\nge\xE7mi\u015Fin izlerini takip etmeli\r\nve
        Hollowvale\u2019in \xFCzerine \xE7\xF6ken b\xFCy\xFCk laneti sona erdirmelidir."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
